# CMSpeak sibling repo

CMSpeak is **not** inside the Reave git tree. It lives at **`../cmspeak`** (sibling of this repo root) — [eliteweblabs/cmspeak](https://github.com/eliteweblabs/cmspeak).

## When the task touches CMSpeak

- Site registry, content JSON, overlay script, edit API → edit **`../cmspeak`** (or the **cmspeak** root if the workspace is `reave.code-workspace`).
- Reave admin Git website edits → **`plugins/content-management/`** — do not conflate with CMSpeak.

## Quick map

| Concern | Where |
|--------|--------|
| `content/registry.json`, `content/sites/*.json` | cmspeak |
| `public/cmspeak.js`, `/api/sites/…/content` | cmspeak |
| Deploy / env (`PUBLIC_CMSPEAK_URL`, `CMS_DATA_DIR`) | cmspeak Railway service |
| Agent `write_github_file` on `{slug}-site` | reave `content_management` |

Dev: Reave `4321`, CMSpeak `4322` (`npm run dev` in each repo).

See [docs/cmspeak.md](../docs/cmspeak.md).
